      },
      {
        "card_id": "003302",
        "transcript": "Go past the exhibition hall and register at the second-floor service desk.",
        "target_signal": "在“地点”任务中依据题面证据完成选项判断",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "003303",
        "transcript": "Passengers for the coastal line should wait on platform 4 until the replacement train arrives.",
        "target_signal": "理解等待地点与结束条件",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "003304",
        "transcript": "You can enter through the main gate, but the documents are stored in the archive room on the lower level.",
        "target_signal": "根据录音材料准确理解地点",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "003305",
        "transcript": "Most visitors entered through the main gate, but the complaints were about delays at the parking exit.",
        "target_signal": "根据录音材料准确理解地点",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "003306",
        "transcript": "The seminar itself will be held in room 3B of the north building, while check-in takes place at the reception counter outside.",
        "target_signal": "在“地点”任务中识别并解释关键知识或解题线索",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "003307",
        "transcript": "The information desk is on the ground floor, opposite the main entrance. Printed course materials are available there. The office upstairs only deals with accommodation questions.",
        "target_signal": "根据楼层和方位定位",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "003308",
        "transcript": "Today's talk has moved from the library hall to Room Six in the science building. The hall is being used for an examination. Signs at the library entrance will direct you to the new location.",
        "target_signal": "追踪活动地点的变更",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "003309",
        "transcript": "We will finish the discussion in the arts building at noon. Lunch is arranged in the café behind the sports centre, not in the canteen next to the library.",
        "target_signal": "区分相邻建筑的功能",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "003310",
        "transcript": "The front entrance has several steps. The accessible entrance is at the back of the building, beside the small garden. Follow the path on the left to reach it.",
        "target_signal": "利用方向词确定入口",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "003311",
        "transcript": "While the main library desk is being repaired, borrowing and returns will be handled in the temporary office beside the lecture theatre. The reading rooms remain open in their usual location.",
        "target_signal": "识别新的服务位置",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "003312",
        "transcript": "New students should go to Room Four for the welcome briefing. Continuing students will meet in Room Nine to discuss optional courses. Both rooms are on the first floor of the student centre.",
        "target_signal": "把地点与指定对象对应",
